Dagu.

396
00:40:02,840 --> 00:40:04,760
-Bos. -Hei, kamu terlihat tegang.

397
00:40:04,840 --> 00:40:06,160
Dan kamu tidak?

398
00:40:17,440 --> 00:40:18,520
Catatan.

399
00:40:19,480 --> 00:40:20,760
Hei kawan.

400
00:40:21,680 --> 00:40:23,720
-Kamu baik-baik saja? -Tentu saja.

401
00:40:24,720 --> 00:40:27,440
